  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.2:\n\t\t\t- Added ConfigHelper for simplified access to appsettings and environment configs.\n\t\t\t- Added CacheHelper for fast in-memory caching with expiration.\n\t\t\t- Added CryptoHelper for AES encryption, decryption, and hashing.\n\t\t\t- Added ValidationHelper for PAN, Aadhaar, IFSC, GSTIN, and Email validation.\n\t\t\t- Added EmailHelper for SMTP-based async email sending.\n\t\t\t- Added NetworkHelper for connectivity and local IP detection.\n\t\t\t- Added PerformanceHelper for measuring async execution time.\n\t\t\t- Added ReflectionHelper for inspecting object properties and methods.\n\t\t\t- Added FileTypeHelper for detecting MIME types by file extension.",
